  m_Text: "\nPlease read these Terms and Conditions (\"Terms\") carefully before
    using our mobile application (\"App\"). By downloading, accessing, or using our
    App, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by
    these Terms. If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use our App.\r\n\r\nUser
    Agreement\r\na. You must be at least 13 years old to use our App. If you are
    a minor in your jurisdiction, you must obtain parental consent before using our
    App.\r\nb. You agree to comply with all applicable laws and regulations while
    using our App.\r\nc. You are solely responsible for maintaining the confidentiality
    and security of your account, including any login credentials associated with
    it.\r\n\r\nIntellectual Property Rights\r\na. All content, graphics, designs,
    logos, trademarks, and any other intellectual property rights associated with
    our App are owned by Spare Squares or our licensors.\r\nb. You are granted a
    limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use our App for personal,
    non-commercial purposes only.\r\nc. You may not reproduce, modify, distribute,
    display, or exploit any part of our App without our prior written consent.\r\n\r\nUser
    Conduct\r\na. You agree not to use our App or any associated features to create
    or display screen names, profiles, or content that is offensive, defamatory,
    discriminatory, or violates any applicable laws or regulations.\r\nb. We reserve
    the right to suspend or terminate your account and restrict your access to our
    App if we determine, in our sole discretion, that your screen name, profile,
    or content violates this provision or is otherwise inappropriate.\r\n\r\nPrivacy
    Policy\r\na. We collect and process personal information in accordance with our
    Privacy Policy. By using our App, you consent to the collection and processing
    of your personal information as described in our Privacy Policy.\r\n\r\nAdvertising\r\na.
    Our App may display advertisements from third-party advertising networks, such
    as Google Ads.\r\nb. The display of advertisements does not constitute an endorsement,
    representation, or warranty of any kind regarding the advertised products or
    services.\r\nc. We are not responsible for the content or accuracy of the advertisements
    displayed in our App.\r\n\r\nLimitation of Liability\r\na. To the fullest extent
    permitted by applicable law, we shall not be liable for any direct, indirect,
    incidental, special, consequential, or exemplary damages, including but not limited
    to, damages for loss of profits, goodwill, use, data, or other intangible losses
    arising out of or in connection with your use of our App.\r\nb. We do not warrant
    that our App will be error-free, uninterrupted, or free from viruses or other
    harmful components.\r\nc. Some jurisdictions do not allow the exclusion or limitation
    of liability for consequential or incidental damages, so the above limitation
    may not apply to you.\r\n\r\nJurisdiction\r\na. These Terms shall be governed
    by and construed in accordance with the laws of Israel.\r\nb. Any legal action
    or proceeding arising out of or relating to these Terms shall be exclusively
    brought in the courts of Israel.\r\n\r\nGeneral Provisions\r\na. These Terms
    constitute the entire agreement between you and us regarding your use of our
    App.\r\nb. If any provision of these Terms is found to be invalid or unenforceable,
    the remaining provisions shall continue to be valid and enforceable.\r\nc. Our
    failure to enforce any right or provision of these Terms shall not be deemed
    a waiver of such right or provision.\r\n\r\nBy using our App, you agree to abide
    by these Terms and Conditions. If you have any questions or concerns, please
    contact us at info@spare-squares.com .\r\n\r\n\rPrivacy Policy\r\n\r\nEffective
    Date: Dec 1, 2023\r\n\r\nThis Privacy Policy (\"Policy\") describes how we collect,
    use, disclose, and protect the personal information of users (\"Users\") who
    download, access, or use our mobile application (\"App\"). By using our App,
    you consent to the practices described in this Policy. If you do not agree with
    this Policy, please do not use our App.\r\n\r\nInformation We Collect\r\na. Personal
    Information: We may collect personal information such as the username you enter,
    your email address, your Google/Apple ID, and your device information when you
    register an account or contact us for support.\r\nb. Non-Personal Information:
    We may collect non-personal information such as your device type, IP address,
    usage statistics, and preferences, which are used to enhance your experience
    with our App.\r\n\r\nUse of Information\r\na. We may use the personal information
    we collect to provide, maintain, and improve our App, respond to your inquiries
    and support requests, and personalize your experience.\r\nb. Non-personal information
    may be used to analyze usage patterns, improve our services, and for marketing
    and advertising purposes.\r\n\r\nDisclosure of Information\r\na. We do not sell,
    trade, or rent personal information to third parties.\r\nb. We may share personal
    information with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating
    our App and providing services to Users, subject to their agreement to keep such
    information confidential.\r\nc. We may disclose personal information if required
    by law, regulation, or legal process, or in response to a valid request by law
    enforcement or government authorities.\r\n\r\nData Security\r\na. We take reasonable
    measures to protect personal information from unauthorized access, alteration,
    disclosure, or destruction.\r\nb. However, no data transmission or storage system
    can be guaranteed to be 100% secure. Therefore, while we strive to protect your
    personal information, we cannot guarantee its absolute security.\r\n\r\nThird-Party
    Services and Links\r\na. Our App may contain links to third-party websites or
    services that are not owned or controlled by us. This Policy does not apply to
    such third-party services, and we are not responsible for their privacy practices.
    We encourage you to review the privacy policies of those third parties.\r\n\r\nChildren's
    Privacy\r\na. Our App is not directed to children under the age of 13. We do
    not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we become
    aware that personal information of a child under 13 has been provided to us,
    we will take steps to delete such information.\r\n\r\nChanges to this Policy\r\na.
    We may update this Policy from time to time by posting a revised version in our
    App. The revised version will be effective as of the date specified in the updated
    Policy.\r\nb. We encourage you to review this Policy periodically to stay informed
    about our privacy practices.\r\n\r\nContact Us\r\nIf you have any questions,
    concerns, or requests regarding your user information or this Policy or our privacy
    practices, please contact us at info@spare-squares.com .\r\n\r\nBy using our
    App, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to this Privacy
    Policy.\n\r\n\r\n"
